============================================================
Terraform
============================================================
Terraform working directory

.terraform/

Terraform state files

.tfstate .tfstate.* *.tfstate.backup

Terraform crash logs

crash.log crash.*.log

Terraform plan files

.tfplan .plan

Terraform override files

override.tf override.tf.json override.tf *_override.tf.json

Terraform variable files containing secrets
NOTE: Keep .tfvars tracked only if they contain no secrets.

*.tfvars *.tfvars.json

============================================================
Terraform Provider Lock File
============================================================
DO NOT ignore this file.
.terraform.lock.hcl should normally be committed.

#

.terraform.lock.hcl
